    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ni madzina ga atu a Iziraeli ambao amuhumikira mfalume kuhusu mambo gosi ga kuphiya vihani mwezi bada ya mwezi hadi mwaka mzima. Atalwa chi akulu a mbari, akulu a vikosi vya anajeshi elufu-elufu na akulu a vikosi vya anajeshi gana-gana na maofisaa gao ga utawala. Chila kundi rakala na jumula ya atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zuma ra kpwandza ra mwezi wa kpwandza, raimirirwa ni Jashobeamu mwana wa Zabudieli. Zumare kala rina atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye wala chivyazi cha Peresi wa mbari ya Juda, naye kala ni mkpwulu wa amiri-jeshi osi a hinyo mwezi wa kpwandza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dodai, Muahohi waimirira zuma ra mwezi wa phiri na Mikilothi kala ndiye msaidiziwe na mkpwulu wa ro kundi. Zumare kala rina atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkpwulu wa jeshi wa hahu, ariyekala mkpwulu wa mwezi wa hahu, kala ni Benaya, mwana wa mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada. Zumare kala rina atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyu ni yuya Benaya ariyekala kati ya hara masujaa mirongo mihahu na yekala mkpwulu wao. Mwanawe Amizabadi ndiye ariyeimirira zumare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaheli mwanao wa Joabu ni wa ne, waimirira mwezi wa ne, na walungirwa ni mwanawe Zebadia. Zumare kala rina atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkpwulu wa jeshi wa tsano, ariyeimirira mwezi wa tsano, ni Shamuhuthi wa mbari ya Izirahi. Zumare kala rina atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa sita, ariyeimirira mwezi wa sita kala ni Ira mwana wa Ikeshi wa kula mudzi wa Tekoa. Zumare kala rina atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa sabaa, ariyeimirira mwezi wa sabaa, kala ni Helesi wa kula mudzi wa Peloni, wa chivyazi cha Efuraimu. Zumare kala rina atu elufu mirongo miiri na ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
